meta { name: Publish, type: http, seq: 3 }

post { url: {{adminBase}}/articles/{{articleId}}/publish, body: none, auth: none }

headers { Cookie: {{sessionCookie}} }

docs {
  A verb on a sub-resource, never PATCH { status } — that keeps the transition's
  guards explicit and stops a generic update becoming a way around the aggregate.

  422 ARTICLE_MISSING_EXCERPT / ARTICLE_MISSING_COVER_IMAGE until both are set.
  Both feed the share preview, which is the product's whole promise.

  Idempotent: publishing twice does not move publishedAt. Unpublishing does not
  clear it either — it is the canonical FIRST publication date.

  Requires editor or admin. A contributor gets 403.
}
